# Frontend build-time configuration. Vite exposes only variables prefixed VITE_.
# Copy to `.env` if you need to override defaults. `.env` is git-ignored.

# Backend API base URL.
# - LOCAL DEV: leave UNSET. The Vite dev server proxies /api and /health to the
#   backend at http://127.0.0.1:8000, so the app works exactly as before.
# - PRODUCTION: set to your deployed backend origin, NO trailing slash, e.g.
#     https://yantrasetu-api.onrender.com
#   On Netlify/Vercel, set this in the site's environment variables (do not
#   commit a real production URL).
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
